{"ID":"20240205153739-mntxsko","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153739-mntxsko","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153739-mntxsko\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103423-w62c8d2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612091142-t9fhzdm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240626083152-9y4xoy1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"207吴茱萸","type":"doc","updated":"20240821093143"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206103423-w62c8d2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103423-w62c8d2","updated":"20240206103431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产云贵地区以及湖南等地。\n【性状】\t果实呈五角状扁球形，直径2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5mm。表面暗黄绿色至褐色，粗糙，有点状突起或凹下的油点。顶端有五角星状的裂隙，基部残留被有黄色茸毛的果梗。质硬而脆。气芳香浓郁，味辛辣而苦。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，热，有小毒。\n【功效】\t散寒止痛、降逆止呕。用于治疗肝胃虚寒、阴浊上逆所致的头痛或胃脘疼痛等症。\n【注解】\t“子眼”：指吴茱萸药材表面具有多数点状突起或凹下的腺点，即油室。"}]},{"ID":"20240206103424-xa2x6kq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103424-xa2x6kq","updated":"20240206103424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206103424-g7vuml3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205161843-ccdhm9g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205161843-ccdhm9g","updated":"20240205161843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"吴茱萸"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeL